{"t":"Bear Room Quest/Spoiler","s":"bear-room-quest-spoiler-81b29","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Bear_Room_Quest_1_7f535d.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Bear Room Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Chain Armor Quest.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"timealloc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Est. Length</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5-10 minutes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(6 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.2<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">March 17, 2000<br/>Beta 5.2</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>...\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> main cave.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Rat\">Rat</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider\">Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Young%20Troll\">Young Trolls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Trolls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">Bear</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Chain%20Armor\">Chain Armor</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Helmet\">Brass Helmet</a>, 12 <a href=\"#/wiki/Arrow\">Arrows</a> and 40 gp\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204601\">Key 4601</a> to bear room, or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a> to get it (for methods on how to obtain a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a> on Rookgaard, see the <a href=\"#/quest/pick-quest\">Pick Quest</a> article).</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Go to the abandoned building a little north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> and down the hole.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bear Room Quest 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"157\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bear_Room_Quest_1_7f535d.png\" width=\"148\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Go east and down (<a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Trolls</a> here).</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bear Room Quest 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"191\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bear_Room_Quest_2_48c8cb.png\" width=\"210\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Go down again like it is shown on this map. There are a few <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a> here.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bear Room Quest 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"191\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bear_Room_Quest_3_c1fe8c.png\" width=\"210\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Go down again. There are 2-4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a> here. It's fairly easy to out run them.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bear Room Quest 4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"191\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bear_Room_Quest_4_b1eda0.png\" width=\"210\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Final level - There are 1-2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a> in this room.</li></ul>\n<p>To retrieve the key, use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">pick</a> on the mud floor square directly south of the big table. A hole will appear for you to go down. Downstairs is a chest with <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204601\">Key 4601</a>; take it and go back up the ladder.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bearroom6\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"232\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bearroom6_894b8a.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></span>\n</p><p>North of the big table is a switch which controls the stone which can block the door to the bear room further north. If the stone is blocking the door, remove it by using the switch. Go through the door and kill the <a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">Bear</a>, afterwards open all three boxes to get your reward.<br/><b>Note:</b> If someone has blocked the way back you can use the sewer grate to go down to a room with 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider\">Spiders</a>, and then up the ladder to the south in order to get back into the central room with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bear Room Quest 5\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"191\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bear_Room_Quest_5_50c026.png\" width=\"210\"/></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>Note:</b> Next to the stone switch is the chest for the <a href=\"#/quest/present-quest\">Present Box Quest</a>.\n</p></div>","quests":[]}